\STATE Iterate until $e^2(\theta,\phi_1,...,\phi_p)$fails to decrease;\\
\STATE Iterate until $e^2(\theta,\phi_1,...,\phi_p)$fails to decrease;\\
\STATE For $k=1$ to p Do:\\
